1
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,000
Candied haws!

2
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:19,350
Sweet and crispy candied haws!

3
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,190
Candied haws!

4
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,830
Sweet and crispy candied haws!

5
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:23,710
Selling cheap!

6
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:26,110
Little girl, do you
want some candied haws?

7
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:28,190
Look at you drooling!

8
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,230
Give me a stick of candied haws.

9
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:32,070
Okay.

10
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,030
Here you go.

11
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,490
Take it.

12
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,320
Eat up.

13
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,560
Is it good?

14
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,320
At my place,

15
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:44,520
I have a lot of
yummy food and fun toys.

16
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:45,600
Come with me,

17
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,900
and they're all yours.

18
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,130
Let's go.

19
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:04,709
The good stuff is outside.

20
00:01:04,730 --> 00:01:06,450
If anyone asks,

21
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,840
just say you're my daughter.

22
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,010
Officer,

23
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,660
I'm taking my daughter out of the city.

24
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:18,539
Dad!

25
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:24,070
These days, human traffickers

26
00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:26,800
don't even care
who the child's parents are, huh?

27
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,280
Scared?

28
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:32,009
We don't have to do it the hard way.

29
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:33,750
I'm not a fan of blood either.

30
00:01:34,039 --> 00:01:34,970
I know the rules.

31
00:01:35,039 --> 00:01:36,660
Twenty silver dollars for ransom.

32
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:37,460
I'll pay.

33
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,039
It's not just you.

34
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:40,870
The fake beggar behind you

35
00:01:41,030 --> 00:01:43,759
and the candied haw seller
are your accomplices.

36
00:01:43,789 --> 00:01:45,920
I've memorized all your faces.

37
00:01:46,229 --> 00:01:48,509
Sixty silver dollars, not a dollar less.

38
00:01:55,979 --> 00:01:58,580
Your daughter made
60 silver dollars in total,

39
00:01:58,970 --> 00:02:00,430
and you want to take that much?

40
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:01,920
My daughter made 60.

41
00:02:02,070 --> 00:02:03,350
I'm taking 20.

42
00:02:03,690 --> 00:02:05,520
How's that greedy?

43
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:08,310
There are 40 silver dollars in here.

44
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:12,870
Aren't you lot
in the business of scamming?

45
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,590
You must be terrified of getting caught.

46
00:02:14,590 --> 00:02:16,910
Consider this symbolic hush money

47
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,590
to give you peace of mind.

48
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:23,800
You're right.

49
00:02:24,079 --> 00:02:25,410
To give us peace of mind.

50
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,310
Peace of mind is indeed very important.

51
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:30,030
Take Jiang Feiyan for example.

52
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:31,470
She knows we're scammers,

53
00:02:31,470 --> 00:02:34,150
so she must join Tianxiang Sect
and follow the rules.

54
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:36,079
That way, we'll have peace of mind.

55
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:39,870
That's what I'm talking about, kid.

56
00:02:40,910 --> 00:02:41,910
You're sensible.

57
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:48,150
I have one more question.

58
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:51,250
You also know we're scammers,

59
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:53,760
but I don't want you
to join Tianxiang Sect.

60
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,710
What should we do then?

61
00:02:58,110 --> 00:02:59,829
I've already taken the money.

62
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,310
Trust that my lips are sealed.

63
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:03,310
If my child makes money again,

64
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,010
I'll just ask you for it.

65
00:03:07,430 --> 00:03:08,630
I'll get going.

66
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:24,320
[A Prophet]

67
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:27,400
[Episode 18]

68
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:31,770
[Press Area]

69
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,760
["Alluring Phantom"
Movie Press Conference]

70
00:05:40,020 --> 00:05:42,720
[Alluring Phantom]

71
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:44,140
[Yunhe Temple]

72
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,310
Please.

73
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,480
Master.

74
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:48,600
How is it?

75
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,550
I think I did a pretty good job

76
00:05:50,659 --> 00:05:52,659
redecorating your esteemed place.

77
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,159
I didn't cut any corners.

78
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:56,360
It cost me a pretty penny.

79
00:05:56,870 --> 00:05:57,950
But I have to say,

80
00:05:58,190 --> 00:05:59,750
this idea of yours is

81
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,160
brilliant.

82
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:04,600
Silence!

83
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,270
Listen.

84
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:18,310
Mr. Tang,

85
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,040
you really went all out.

86
00:06:20,790 --> 00:06:22,030
You know your stuff.

87
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:23,630
I hired the most expensive

88
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:26,040
and professional music team
in the industry.

89
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,270
They'll hide in that room.

90
00:06:27,270 --> 00:06:28,250
With my signal,

91
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,150
they'll play whatever

92
00:06:29,150 --> 00:06:30,410
sound effect you need.

93
00:06:45,890 --> 00:06:46,800
What about the atmosphere?

94
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,730
The atmosphere!

95
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:50,720
Spread it evenly.

96
00:06:55,270 --> 00:06:56,480
Enough. Leave.

97
00:06:59,070 --> 00:07:00,000
Yang Xiaozhong,

98
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,960
is it just me,

99
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:04,160
or is the visual a bit flat?

100
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:07,800
For Miss Manyu's entrance,
do you think she should

101
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,190
fly down from the sky

102
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,960
or pop out from the ground?

103
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:14,270
Can't she just walk out of the crowd?

104
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,120
No, no, no.

105
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,920
Master.

106
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:16,920
The visuals.

107
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:18,070
It must be

108
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:19,390
a visual spectacle that

109
00:07:19,390 --> 00:07:20,870
stays with the audience forever.

110
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,160
Art Director, come here.

111
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:22,920
Take note of this.

112
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,000
Get the lighting team

113
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,510
to make a lightning bolt.

114
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:28,120
With a crack of thunder,

115
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:28,920
Miss Manyu will be

116
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,430
blasted out from the ground.

117
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:32,050
That will be explosive enough.

118
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:33,130
Everyone's eyes

119
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:35,570
will be fixed on Manyu and only Manyu.

120
00:07:35,590 --> 00:07:36,740
An event that will

121
00:07:36,770 --> 00:07:39,300
drain every journalist's camera battery.

122
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:41,830
Since we want this to be believable,

123
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,680
wouldn't it make more sense

124
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:46,130
for the spirit to possess a normal person?

125
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:48,870
Did you hear that?

126
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,870
That's professionalism.

127
00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:51,750
Your suggestion is excellent.

128
00:07:51,750 --> 00:07:54,600
But I have a small request.

129
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,750
Before Miss Manyu is possessed,

130
00:07:56,770 --> 00:08:00,330
I'll invite you to make a grand entrance.

131
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:03,480
You'll go on stage to
perform a grand ritual.

132
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,750
I'll have Sound and Lighting
fully cooperate with you.

133
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:08,160
On the surface, it's to
pray for this movie's success.

134
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,070
But

135
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,950
during the prayer,

136
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,000
the ghost will return

137
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:15,000
and possess Miss Manyu.

138
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,070
The eerie vibes will be off the charts.

139
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:19,270
I need a dramatic moment to play out then.

140
00:08:19,270 --> 00:08:22,590
I want time to freeze at that moment.

141
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,480
I want that moment to be

142
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,280
imprinted in everyone's minds.

143
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:32,380
Why not have He Manzhi
strangle you to death?

144
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,630
Can she do it?

145
00:08:34,870 --> 00:08:35,720
Well...

146
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,380
Of course,

147
00:08:37,049 --> 00:08:39,970
the strangulation pressure
must be regulated.

148
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,120
She can't just keep

149
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,870
strangling me, or I could die.

150
00:08:42,890 --> 00:08:44,090
This strangulation

151
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,670
is just a means,

152
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:46,600
not an end.

153
00:08:46,620 --> 00:08:47,740
What's the end?

154
00:08:47,910 --> 00:08:50,550
It's to make everyone
who sees me being strangled

155
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:51,960
feel a kind of...

156
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:54,790
Sadness.

157
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,440
Heartache.

158
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,720
Anxiety.

159
00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:59,400
No one will be anxious for you.

160
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:01,030
It's not up to me to decide

161
00:09:01,030 --> 00:09:02,190
if she'll strangle you.

162
00:09:02,190 --> 00:09:05,000
We'll have to see what Ms. He does then.

163
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,810
She probably won't
have the heart to do it.

164
00:09:14,940 --> 00:09:16,060
Mr. Tang.

165
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:19,970
Look at what's written in this contract.

166
00:09:20,550 --> 00:09:22,690
The company wants me to
act in a designated script

167
00:09:22,690 --> 00:09:23,720
but won't let me interfere

168
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,850
with the plot and character settings.

169
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,790
You guys want me

170
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:29,670
to be a puppet on a string,

171
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,610
but you don't respect me at all.

172
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:32,380
Seriously.

173
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:37,910
What are you still doing here?

174
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:39,690
Didn't you say there's still
an outstanding payment?

175
00:09:39,690 --> 00:09:40,640
Go settle it now!

176
00:09:40,670 --> 00:09:41,840
How about this?

177
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:42,980
You cover it first.

178
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,360
Tang,

179
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:46,480
when you said to go all in that day,

180
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,670
it really pumped me up—

181
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:48,870
Keep your voice down.

182
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,200
I've transferred
all of my net worth to you.

183
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,390
What else do I have to cover it with?

184
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:54,360
That's not my problem.

185
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,390
Listen.

186
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,500
If you mess this up,

187
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:59,000
don't blame me for getting harsh with you.

188
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,390
I'm done talking to you.

189
00:10:00,390 --> 00:10:01,920
I have to go find the master.

190
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,440
Go settle it now.

191
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,600
Don't just stand here like an idiot.

192
00:10:17,790 --> 00:10:18,840
Was the movie good?

193
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,390
Yes!

194
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,630
Actually,

195
00:10:25,650 --> 00:10:27,450
what you saw today

196
00:10:28,290 --> 00:10:30,290
can only be deemed half a movie.

197
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:32,430
That this trouble-ridden half

198
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:34,390
is able to meet today's audience

199
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,320
is entirely due to the protection

200
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:38,050
and stewardship of one person.

201
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,320
Let us

202
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,000
welcome him!

203
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,600
Who?

204
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,080
I don't see anyone.

205
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:46,870
There's no one.

206
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:48,480
Tang Yushan.

207
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,030
What's that sound?

208
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,440
It's so creepy.

209
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:00,700
Technical issue!

210
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,440
What are you doing?

211
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,480
What's with this sound effect?

212
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,550
Did I tell you to play it?

213
00:11:07,550 --> 00:11:09,320
Didn't I tell you to wait for my signal?

214
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,630
It's not us.

215
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,300
We didn't touch anything!

216
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:15,960
Look and listen.

217
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,870
Listen for yourself!

218
00:11:16,870 --> 00:11:18,260
Look and listen for yourself.

219
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:20,380
I thought you found another team.

220
00:11:20,410 --> 00:11:21,670
Did you see the master?

221
00:11:21,830 --> 00:11:22,990
No, I didn't.

222
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:27,750
Master!

223
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,360
Master!

224
00:11:36,620 --> 00:11:37,880
What's wrong, Master?

225
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,280
What happened to you?

226
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,390
That female ghost

227
00:11:40,850 --> 00:11:42,140
is too hostile.

228
00:11:42,450 --> 00:11:43,330
I...

229
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,000
I can't suppress her anymore.

230
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,580
You must suppress her!

231
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,790
I've built up all this atmosphere...

232
00:11:49,790 --> 00:11:51,000
I doubled the pay!

233
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:53,160
How can you say you can't suppress her?

234
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:54,840
What's with the coffin?

235
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:58,870
Master, hold on.

236
00:11:58,870 --> 00:11:59,720
Hang in there!

237
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,360
It's moving!

238
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:53,470
What the heck is that?

239
00:12:53,670 --> 00:12:54,400
What is that?

240
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:55,240
I don't know.

241
00:13:09,270 --> 00:13:10,310
Don't panic, everyone!

242
00:13:10,310 --> 00:13:11,240
Don't be afraid.

243
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,320
This is

244
00:13:12,510 --> 00:13:13,870
a little surprise

245
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:16,510
I arranged for you.

246
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:17,320
Come on.

247
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:18,720
Come closer.

248
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:19,480
Nothing to be afraid of!

249
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:21,030
Come.

250
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:23,630
Come closer.

251
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:25,910
Get the full experience.

252
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,750
What is all this mess?

253
00:13:32,770 --> 00:13:34,060
Why is there a coffin?

254
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:36,010
Your costume is wrong too.

255
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:37,250
Where's the necklace?

256
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:38,710
Why aren't you wearing it?

257
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:39,670
Go put it on.

258
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:44,120
The movie you just saw on screen

259
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:47,550
is "Alluring Phantom," the posthumous work

260
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,490
of my late wife, He Manzhi.

261
00:13:49,550 --> 00:13:52,080
Unfortunately, halfway through filming,

262
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,720
Manzhi passed away.

263
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:56,320
In order to see Manzhi again,

264
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:58,080
I went out of my way to find

265
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,540
a master from Yunhe Temple

266
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,000
to help me

267
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,600
summon back He Manzhi's soul

268
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:04,510
and have it take over

269
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:06,240
the carefully selected

270
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:08,200
Miss Jiang Manyu's body.

271
00:14:08,390 --> 00:14:10,790
This is to ensure that this movie shoot

272
00:14:10,810 --> 00:14:12,600
can be completed smoothly,

273
00:14:12,630 --> 00:14:14,470
so I can make up for my regrets.

274
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:15,900
Thank you all.

275
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,500
Why are you still here?

276
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,750
Go put on the necklace

277
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:20,240
now.

278
00:14:23,540 --> 00:14:25,820
Do you like that necklace?

279
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,200
Manyu, listen up.

280
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:29,050
This is not the time to joke around.

281
00:14:29,050 --> 00:14:30,150
I can replace you in a heartbeat.

282
00:14:30,150 --> 00:14:30,790
Go now.

283
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:34,320
Manyu...

284
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,600
Do I...

285
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:41,760
look like Jiang Manyu?

286
00:14:44,550 --> 00:14:45,320
Let go.

287
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:46,960
Let go of me!

288
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,120
What?

289
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:52,000
Do you...

290
00:14:53,890 --> 00:14:56,040
not like holding my hand anymore?

291
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:58,960
Man...

292
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,550
Manzhi.

293
00:15:03,670 --> 00:15:05,670
How'd you come back without wearing

294
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,010
the necklace?

295
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:10,670
Let go...

296
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,240
Let go.

297
00:15:18,530 --> 00:15:21,760
♪ It tightens more; even broken,
our bond endures ♪

298
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:25,720
♪ We love each other like crazy ♪

299
00:15:26,230 --> 00:15:28,980
♪ We're a pair in this life ♪

300
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:31,800
♪ Lying in one bed;
sharing one coffin when dead ♪

301
00:15:31,870 --> 00:15:36,720
♪ Even if we turn to ashes,
we still belong together ♪

302
00:15:35,550 --> 00:15:37,630
Master, save me!

303
00:15:37,630 --> 00:15:39,150
Tang Yushan.

304
00:15:38,510 --> 00:15:40,730
♪ Don't look back or panic ♪

305
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:42,750
You think a mere sorcerer
can save your life?

306
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:43,980
♪ I'm right here, by your side ♪

307
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,320
Listen up.

308
00:15:44,430 --> 00:15:46,640
♪ Lean against your back
and breathe your scent ♪

309
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,360
Ever since the day

310
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,270
I possessed Ms. Manyu,

311
00:15:47,250 --> 00:15:51,630
♪ With cold long nails,
I loosen your robe ♪

312
00:15:48,550 --> 00:15:50,870
I've been in her body.

313
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:53,200
I've never left.

314
00:15:52,830 --> 00:15:55,490
♪ We love each other like crazy ♪

315
00:15:53,870 --> 00:15:55,930
This is the day I've been waiting for.

316
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:58,720
♪ Through every life,
we remain a pair ♪

317
00:15:57,910 --> 00:15:58,910
Tang Yushan!

318
00:15:58,910 --> 00:16:01,000
Even when I'm dead,

319
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:01,980
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

320
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:03,270
you still want to exploit me!

321
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,790
Exploit her?

322
00:16:04,790 --> 00:16:05,480
Yeah.

323
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:07,080
How did Mr. Tang exploit her?

324
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:10,870
Thank the heavens.

325
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,120
Miss Manzhi has returned!

326
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:14,480
-What?
-Manzhi?

327
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,480
Didn't you say...

328
00:16:17,010 --> 00:16:20,200
Didn't you say you've been missing me

329
00:16:20,670 --> 00:16:22,320
and dying to see me?

330
00:16:22,470 --> 00:16:24,520
Now that I'm back,

331
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:27,960
why don't you seem happy at all?

332
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,550
I...

333
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:30,630
I'm happy—

334
00:16:30,890 --> 00:16:33,300
♪ I'm right here, by your side ♪

335
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,240
Tang Yushan.

336
00:16:33,690 --> 00:16:36,300
♪ Lean against your back
and breathe your scent ♪

337
00:16:34,790 --> 00:16:35,670
Give me a smile.

338
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,390
I like seeing you smile.

339
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:41,300
♪ With cold long nails,
I loosen your robe ♪

340
00:16:37,510 --> 00:16:38,490
Smile.

341
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:39,750
Smile!

342
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,750
Didn't you say you'd love me forever?

343
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:45,290
♪ We love each other like crazy ♪

344
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:43,720
Say you love me.

345
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,550
Say you love me!

346
00:16:44,550 --> 00:16:45,030
Say it!

347
00:16:45,550 --> 00:16:46,720
Say you love me!

348
00:16:45,850 --> 00:16:48,290
♪ Through every life,
we remain a pair ♪

349
00:16:46,870 --> 00:16:47,630
I love you.

350
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:48,870
I love you.

351
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:51,110
I love you!

352
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:52,720
-I love you!
-Mr. Tang's face is all swollen.

353
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:54,510
I love you!

354
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:57,240
Since you love me,

355
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:01,080
why did you kill me?

356
00:17:03,030 --> 00:17:05,109
Why did you kill me!

357
00:17:05,310 --> 00:17:06,369
I loved you so much!

358
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,160
What?

359
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:08,589
Mr. Tang killed He Manzhi?

360
00:17:08,589 --> 00:17:09,680
What's going on?

361
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,790
Why did you kill me?

362
00:17:10,829 --> 00:17:11,480
Manzhi!

363
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:12,790
Manzhi!

364
00:17:26,130 --> 00:17:27,089
Yes.

365
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:29,200
I admit

366
00:17:29,690 --> 00:17:32,010
I killed you with my own hands.

367
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:35,070
I shouldn't have yielded to you

368
00:17:35,350 --> 00:17:37,110
and let you shoot those scenes

369
00:17:37,130 --> 00:17:39,500
that drained you.

370
00:17:41,790 --> 00:17:44,240
To protect your reputation,

371
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,680
I hid the fact

372
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:48,750
that you had severe depression.

373
00:17:48,750 --> 00:17:50,270
I delayed your treatment.

374
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,640
I let you down!

375
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:53,570
I'm a monster!

376
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:55,790
I, Tang Yushan, let you down!

377
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:58,000
I, Tang Yushan, am a monster!

378
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:02,750
"A Ghost-Possessed Actress
Graces the Silver Screen:

379
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:06,470
Mr. Tang Passionately Plays Out

380
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,880
an Unresolved Sorrow."

381
00:18:08,910 --> 00:18:11,500
Since you believe I killed you,

382
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,640
come on.

383
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:15,070
Kill me so I can

384
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:17,350
accompany you in the afterlife!

385
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,440
Kill me—

386
00:18:20,910 --> 00:18:22,830
You think I don't dare?

387
00:18:24,610 --> 00:18:26,850
Manzhi.

388
00:18:27,550 --> 00:18:28,790
Manzhi...

389
00:18:38,270 --> 00:18:40,140
Fiend, cease your insolence!

390
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:28,420
I hereby announce

391
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:33,290
that the world's first movie
starring a ghost

392
00:19:34,640 --> 00:19:36,240
starts shooting tomorrow.

393
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,160
He Manzhi!

394
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:41,480
Did you see that?

395
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:05,880
Soul, enter!

396
00:20:19,750 --> 00:20:20,640
Manyu?

397
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:26,790
Manzhi?

398
00:20:30,310 --> 00:20:31,270
This won't do!

399
00:20:31,310 --> 00:20:32,200
She's unconscious.

400
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:34,000
She still has to act in the movie!

401
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:37,200
I went out of the city and up the mountain
to find my master.

402
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:39,270
My master went down the mountain
and into the city to find his master.

403
00:20:39,270 --> 00:20:41,550
My master's master went out of the city
and across the river,

404
00:20:41,550 --> 00:20:42,830
dug up his master's grave,

405
00:20:42,830 --> 00:20:44,000
and found this gourd.

406
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,200
I finally subdued it,

407
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:45,800
but you...

408
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,640
I'm just...

409
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:48,030
I...

410
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:48,640
I...

411
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:49,960
I need this

412
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:50,920
and this to...

413
00:20:52,830 --> 00:20:54,590
Figure something out for me!

414
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:57,440
Master.

415
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:59,200
You must

416
00:20:59,350 --> 00:21:00,830
have another solution.

417
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,570
I'm counting on you.

418
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,960
There is a solution.

419
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,600
I need to place this gourd

420
00:21:06,790 --> 00:21:08,160
as an offering at a temple.

421
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:10,350
And I have to negotiate
with He Manzhi's spirit.

422
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:11,310
However,

423
00:21:11,310 --> 00:21:12,960
my Yunhe Temple is too small.

424
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:16,680
You must finance the reconstruction
of a new temple.

425
00:21:16,710 --> 00:21:18,560
No problem. Name your price.

426
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,000
How much?

427
00:21:24,270 --> 00:21:25,110
Master,

428
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:28,570
all my money is in the movie project.

429
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,270
I can't afford that much.

430
00:21:35,270 --> 00:21:36,030
Manyu.

431
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,390
You're awake!

432
00:21:41,910 --> 00:21:42,590
Wait...

433
00:21:43,090 --> 00:21:44,160
Where am I?

434
00:21:44,830 --> 00:21:45,590
Mr. Tang.

435
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:47,170
Aren't we shooting a movie?

436
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,640
Why am I tied up?

437
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:49,770
I'll explain later.

438
00:21:50,260 --> 00:21:51,390
Let's do as you said.

439
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:52,460
As for the money...

440
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,540
I'll figure it out.

441
00:21:55,910 --> 00:21:59,390
[Changfeng Pictures]

442
00:21:56,710 --> 00:21:57,540
Mr. Tang.

443
00:21:57,790 --> 00:21:59,650
He owns half of the lending market

444
00:21:59,710 --> 00:22:00,790
in Yucheng,

445
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:02,110
and I own half.

446
00:22:03,230 --> 00:22:06,080
You came to the right people.

447
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,110
Mr. Tang,

448
00:22:13,240 --> 00:22:14,640
you called us here

449
00:22:14,790 --> 00:22:16,910
just to mortgage a car and a house?

450
00:22:16,930 --> 00:22:19,500
I'm afraid that's not enough collateral.

451
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:23,680
You own half,

452
00:22:24,270 --> 00:22:25,400
and you own half?

453
00:22:25,830 --> 00:22:27,030
That's great.

454
00:22:27,270 --> 00:22:28,350
Then I believe

455
00:22:28,750 --> 00:22:30,030
no news in Yucheng

456
00:22:30,050 --> 00:22:32,050
gets past the two of you.

457
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:35,200
You must read the papers, right?

458
00:22:35,440 --> 00:22:36,920
Everyone is talking about

459
00:22:36,940 --> 00:22:39,420
the movie "Alluring Phantom" now.

460
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:41,640
All the money I'm borrowing from you two

461
00:22:41,640 --> 00:22:44,160
will be used to shoot this movie.

462
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,120
Still not convinced?

463
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:51,940
Then forget it.

464
00:22:51,940 --> 00:22:53,940
I never force anyone into anything.

465
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,640
Mr. Tang,

466
00:22:55,890 --> 00:22:58,330
it seems you have everything ready,

467
00:22:58,750 --> 00:23:00,610
and all you need is a crucial push.

468
00:23:00,790 --> 00:23:01,640
Then...

469
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:05,750
Let us be

470
00:23:07,560 --> 00:23:09,030
that crucial push.

471
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:13,070
Congratulations, Mr. Tang.

472
00:23:13,090 --> 00:23:13,850
No need.

473
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:19,070
I should congratulate you instead.

474
00:23:28,270 --> 00:23:30,360
Cast your eyes afar

475
00:23:31,110 --> 00:23:33,400
to encompass the world.

476
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:47,030
All in.

477
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:50,200
Decide already.

478
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:51,600
My cards aren't good.

479
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:52,920
I need to pee.

480
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,240
Hurry up.

481
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,400
I fold.

482
00:23:57,340 --> 00:23:57,890
And you?

483
00:23:58,960 --> 00:23:59,880
Call.

484
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:01,110
Don't fold.

485
00:24:01,110 --> 00:24:01,960
I can't.

486
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:06,640
What did I say?

487
00:24:06,750 --> 00:24:08,240
I said my cards were bad.

488
00:24:08,510 --> 00:24:09,590
I let you call,

489
00:24:09,830 --> 00:24:11,160
but you didn't dare.

490
00:24:11,350 --> 00:24:12,440
Letting me win, huh?

491
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:13,440
Sorry about this.

492
00:24:13,510 --> 00:24:14,590
Thank you, bosses.

493
00:24:16,510 --> 00:24:17,350
Tang.

494
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:20,070
We've already

495
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:22,310
thrown a lot of cash your way.

496
00:24:22,550 --> 00:24:25,110
Could we invest a bit more

497
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:27,350
in this project of yours?

498
00:24:30,390 --> 00:24:32,100
When I asked you to invest,

499
00:24:32,790 --> 00:24:34,220
you all refused.

500
00:24:34,590 --> 00:24:36,120
It's just like these cards.

501
00:24:36,330 --> 00:24:37,960
Isn't it against the rules

502
00:24:37,990 --> 00:24:39,990
to take back the cards

503
00:24:40,350 --> 00:24:41,480
you've discarded?

504
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,680
It's inappropriate.

505
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:43,550
Next time.

506
00:24:43,550 --> 00:24:45,550
Let's work something out next time.

507
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:47,590
Is this all I am to you?

508
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:49,240
Didn't I invest in

509
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,310
your last movie?

510
00:24:50,310 --> 00:24:50,590
Yes.

511
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:52,680
Even though I lost everything,

512
00:24:52,750 --> 00:24:53,750
look at me now:

513
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:55,710
aren't I still by your side?

514
00:24:58,960 --> 00:25:01,030
We're talking about business now.

515
00:25:01,720 --> 00:25:03,200
Why bring up loyalty?

516
00:25:03,950 --> 00:25:05,120
I'm not a fool.

517
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:08,720
Tang,

518
00:25:09,110 --> 00:25:10,000
no matter what,

519
00:25:10,070 --> 00:25:11,720
you're still a junior.

520
00:25:12,070 --> 00:25:14,160
We came to you with sincerity.

521
00:25:14,820 --> 00:25:16,380
You should watch your tone.

522
00:25:27,470 --> 00:25:28,470
I need to pee.

523
00:25:31,160 --> 00:25:31,960
Let's keep things amicable.

524
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:33,510
Tang, we're all buddies.

525
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:36,780
Have a drink and let it pass.

526
00:25:36,810 --> 00:25:37,930
Let it pass.

527
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:39,480
Tang,

528
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:41,680
we're all in the same circle.

529
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:44,110
Let's put everything on the table.

530
00:25:44,270 --> 00:25:44,960
Right?

531
00:25:45,830 --> 00:25:47,190
Don't be angry.

532
00:25:47,210 --> 00:25:48,870
Come on, let's drink with him.

533
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:49,550
Buddy,

534
00:25:49,590 --> 00:25:50,920
let me toast you, okay?

535
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:51,590
Come on.

536
00:25:51,590 --> 00:25:52,750
Let's toast

537
00:25:52,750 --> 00:25:53,880
Tang together.

538
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:55,200
Come on, Tang.

539
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:55,880
Come on.

540
00:25:56,350 --> 00:25:57,480
I see.

541
00:25:58,200 --> 00:25:58,830
You all

542
00:25:59,270 --> 00:26:00,110
want a chance,

543
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:00,960
right?

544
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:02,030
Okay.

545
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:05,180
I'll give you this chance!

546
00:26:05,190 --> 00:26:06,840
Go all in with me.

547
00:26:10,970 --> 00:26:11,820
Are you game?

548
00:26:26,310 --> 00:26:27,440
Stop following me.

549
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:29,200
Manyu.

550
00:26:33,070 --> 00:26:33,800
How about it?

551
00:26:34,830 --> 00:26:36,390
If you ask me, Mr. Tang,

552
00:26:36,750 --> 00:26:38,310
you should stop following me, okay?

553
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:40,110
The ghost possesses me, not you.

554
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:41,750
Of course you're not afraid.

555
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:43,610
Anyway, I can't act in your movie.

556
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:44,510
Manyu,

557
00:26:44,830 --> 00:26:46,110
I offered you

558
00:26:46,130 --> 00:26:47,760
the same pay as Manzhi.

559
00:26:48,030 --> 00:26:49,200
It's the highest.

560
00:26:49,960 --> 00:26:51,110
Still not satisfied?

561
00:26:51,110 --> 00:26:52,510
Acting in your movie,

562
00:26:52,590 --> 00:26:55,110
I represent both He Manzhi and myself.

563
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:57,680
Shouldn't you pay me double?

564
00:27:00,750 --> 00:27:01,480
Right!

565
00:27:02,510 --> 00:27:04,160
You're right. Double it is!

566
00:27:05,070 --> 00:27:06,140
You're worth it.

567
00:27:09,060 --> 00:27:11,060
Am I short of money?

568
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:13,200
My dad is a bank president.

569
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:14,680
Get it straight.

570
00:27:14,850 --> 00:27:16,240
So...

571
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:18,680
Manyu,

572
00:27:18,790 --> 00:27:19,680
isn't all this

573
00:27:19,680 --> 00:27:21,920
money talk getting a bit

574
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:23,480
too tedious?

575
00:27:23,750 --> 00:27:24,790
What is money?

576
00:27:24,910 --> 00:27:27,310
It's the most worthless thing
in the world.

577
00:27:27,590 --> 00:27:28,790
I think a person

578
00:27:29,440 --> 00:27:30,350
should never

579
00:27:30,350 --> 00:27:31,950
lose sight of what they want.

580
00:27:32,270 --> 00:27:34,550
What you really want is independence.

581
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:37,110
So as long as you act in this movie,

582
00:27:37,110 --> 00:27:39,440
I promise to use all my resources

583
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:40,680
to make you a star.

584
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:41,880
What is a star?

585
00:27:42,350 --> 00:27:43,790
It's the prestige where even

586
00:27:43,790 --> 00:27:46,200
the mayor would be
eager to shake your hand.

587
00:27:46,350 --> 00:27:49,310
It's the respect
your banker father can't buy,

588
00:27:49,330 --> 00:27:51,060
no matter how much money he has!

589
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:02,380
You really have a good eye.

590
00:28:02,410 --> 00:28:04,000
This came in today.

591
00:28:04,410 --> 00:28:07,000
It's rare to find skilled artisans who
can stitch a piece like this these days.

592
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:08,680
All the clothes in the shop today

593
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:09,960
are one of a kind.

594
00:28:13,550 --> 00:28:14,350
Mr. Tang,

595
00:28:14,830 --> 00:28:16,440
which one will look good on me?

596
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:18,170
You'll look good in all of them.

597
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:18,680
Really?

598
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,270
Really.

599
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:21,720
Alright then.

600
00:28:22,400 --> 00:28:23,130
Wrap them up.

601
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:24,270
Which one?

602
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:25,310
All.

603
00:28:28,830 --> 00:28:29,560
Is that okay,

604
00:28:29,750 --> 00:28:30,720
Mr. Tang?

605
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:33,200
Sure.

606
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:35,490
Okay! Please wait a moment.

607
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:39,490
I think you're right, Mr. Tang.

608
00:28:39,700 --> 00:28:41,670
Only these unique clothes

609
00:28:42,070 --> 00:28:43,240
can match

610
00:28:43,510 --> 00:28:45,110
the prestige you'll give me.

611
00:28:46,030 --> 00:28:47,680
Please make the receipt out

612
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:48,790
to the production crew.

613
00:28:48,790 --> 00:28:49,480
Thank you.

614
00:28:50,440 --> 00:28:51,100
Miss Jiang,

615
00:28:51,610 --> 00:28:53,670
the plan is progressing seamlessly.

616
00:28:53,860 --> 00:28:55,490
Now we have the money,

617
00:28:56,070 --> 00:28:58,020
but we're far from done.

618
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:00,480
You're not really going to

619
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:02,680
finish shooting Tang's movie, are you?

620
00:29:24,900 --> 00:29:25,530
Master,

621
00:29:26,350 --> 00:29:27,740
are we just going to watch him?

622
00:29:27,740 --> 00:29:28,940
What do you want to do?

623
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:31,130
This setup belongs to Jiang Feiyan.

624
00:29:31,130 --> 00:29:32,530
She's made a lot of money.

625
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:34,250
It's hard to interfere.

626
00:29:34,440 --> 00:29:35,720
This Wang Jiaxian

627
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:37,750
is within arm's reach, though.

628
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:39,440
That kid Shangguan

629
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:40,970
only dealt with one Cao San.

630
00:29:41,550 --> 00:29:43,160
He's still a little chick.

631
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,690
Just wait for him to slip up.

632
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:46,830
Understood.

633
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:52,030
What does this fate mean?

634
00:29:52,030 --> 00:29:54,110
It means you have
a benefactor in your life.

635
00:29:54,110 --> 00:29:54,480
Really?

636
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:55,240
And they are

637
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:57,930
a benefactor who helps you in life.

638
00:29:59,550 --> 00:30:01,750
The drinks are here. Let's have a toast.

639
00:30:08,590 --> 00:30:09,550
Your husband?

640
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:10,790
No.

641
00:30:13,120 --> 00:30:14,380
What's wrong with you?

642
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:15,830
You're asking for it, huh?

643
00:30:15,830 --> 00:30:16,920
Please calm down.

644
00:30:17,880 --> 00:30:19,480
Don't go. I'll take you home.

645
00:30:20,150 --> 00:30:22,350
I think you should check this out first.

646
00:30:29,470 --> 00:30:30,320
So,

647
00:30:30,350 --> 00:30:31,930
the press conference where you almost died

648
00:30:31,930 --> 00:30:33,240
was orchestrated by you.

649
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:35,300
Do you take us journalists for fools?

650
00:30:35,500 --> 00:30:37,630
Faking a haunting to scare people

651
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:40,250
and deceive investors
and the audience, huh?

652
00:30:41,750 --> 00:30:44,080
Hey, if this gets out,

653
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:45,740
would it be considered

654
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:48,000
huge news?

655
00:30:50,270 --> 00:30:50,830
Sit.

656
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:51,640
Sit?

657
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:52,920
Sit.

658
00:30:54,310 --> 00:30:55,110
Waiter,

659
00:30:55,610 --> 00:30:57,400
a bottle of your best wine.

660
00:30:57,580 --> 00:30:59,660
Put it on Mr. Tang's tab.

661
00:31:02,200 --> 00:31:03,270
I think

662
00:31:03,550 --> 00:31:05,630
your revised script is brilliant.

663
00:31:05,810 --> 00:31:07,960
Especially the scene you added for me,

664
00:31:08,080 --> 00:31:09,360
I really like it.

665
00:31:10,070 --> 00:31:11,070
Director,

666
00:31:11,210 --> 00:31:12,400
what's your opinion?

667
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:14,440
I think the foundation
is pretty much there.

668
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:15,790
Next, we need to dig deeper

669
00:31:15,790 --> 00:31:17,350
into Ms. He's real life

670
00:31:17,350 --> 00:31:19,200
and real experiences.

671
00:31:19,350 --> 00:31:21,350
Great that we're on the same page.

672
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:23,550
I was just worrying about

673
00:31:23,550 --> 00:31:25,310
how to dig deeper.

674
00:31:25,350 --> 00:31:26,310
Ms. He,

675
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:28,650
I have a bunch of questions for you.

676
00:31:28,830 --> 00:31:29,400
First of all...

677
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,640
Wait a second.

678
00:31:34,120 --> 00:31:36,030
Can I share my opinion?

679
00:31:38,580 --> 00:31:39,900
I took a look

680
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,160
at this script.

681
00:31:41,190 --> 00:31:42,500
Personally, I think

682
00:31:43,350 --> 00:31:44,240
it's rubbish.

683
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:47,030
What the hell did you write?

684
00:31:47,030 --> 00:31:48,920
So much pointless foreshadowing!

685
00:31:48,920 --> 00:31:50,240
Will anyone watch this?

686
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:51,920
People want to see Ms. He's

687
00:31:51,940 --> 00:31:52,830
breasts and ass.

688
00:31:52,830 --> 00:31:54,830
Why write that she went to junior high?

689
00:31:54,830 --> 00:31:55,550
Rubbish.

690
00:31:56,110 --> 00:31:57,020
Absolute rubbish.

691
00:31:57,020 --> 00:31:58,370
These are all useless.

692
00:31:58,610 --> 00:32:00,000
Cut the first third.

693
00:32:00,510 --> 00:32:01,750
Just start with the sex scene.

694
00:32:01,750 --> 00:32:04,160
W-What movie starts with a sex scene?

695
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:05,830
Do you want the whole country

696
00:32:05,830 --> 00:32:07,030
to see Ms. He as a joke?

697
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:08,820
Isn't a movie all about jokes?

698
00:32:08,960 --> 00:32:10,420
Don't you guys like jokes?

699
00:32:10,960 --> 00:32:11,720
Manyu,

700
00:32:12,510 --> 00:32:14,110
you like jokes too, right?

701
00:32:16,350 --> 00:32:18,030
That depends on how

702
00:32:18,030 --> 00:32:19,070
the jokes are written.

703
00:32:19,070 --> 00:32:19,920
Anyway,

704
00:32:19,940 --> 00:32:21,660
I have no breasts and no ass.

705
00:32:21,830 --> 00:32:22,590
Even if I did,

706
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:24,270
I wouldn't show them to you.

707
00:32:24,680 --> 00:32:26,000
Ridiculous.

708
00:32:27,070 --> 00:32:27,680
Alright.

709
00:32:28,110 --> 00:32:29,590
The joke is that

710
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:32,160
in real life, my wife dies,

711
00:32:32,180 --> 00:32:33,100
so I'm sad,

712
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:33,790
upset,

713
00:32:33,790 --> 00:32:34,680
and in agony.

714
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:36,640
In the movie, it's still me,

715
00:32:36,640 --> 00:32:38,070
and my wife still dies,

716
00:32:38,070 --> 00:32:39,790
but I'm on cloud nine

717
00:32:39,790 --> 00:32:41,250
and painting the town red.

718
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:42,750
This is called doing the opposite,

719
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:44,160
which is what makes drama.

720
00:32:44,160 --> 00:32:44,830
Am I right?

721
00:32:44,880 --> 00:32:45,750
Mr. Tang, you are

722
00:32:45,750 --> 00:32:47,610
sacrificing a lot for this movie.

723
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:50,680
Not putting money in your own pocket

724
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:52,160
is the real sacrifice.

725
00:32:52,350 --> 00:32:53,350
Just write what

726
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:55,510
appeals to the audience and sells tickets.

727
00:32:55,510 --> 00:32:57,400
He Manzhi's death

728
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:59,440
must be glamorous,

729
00:32:59,790 --> 00:33:01,350
in bed,

730
00:33:01,350 --> 00:33:03,510
and at the hands of her lover.

731
00:33:04,310 --> 00:33:05,070
I object.

732
00:33:06,080 --> 00:33:07,190
I'm not acting in

733
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:08,440
a movie like this.

734
00:33:09,230 --> 00:33:10,020
Mr. Screenwriter,

735
00:33:10,020 --> 00:33:11,670
I'll give you an example.

736
00:33:11,690 --> 00:33:13,800
Take the ghost-catching scenes

737
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:16,440
in this draft of the script.

738
00:33:16,720 --> 00:33:19,510
Our beautiful Manyu
plays the female ghost.

739
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:22,180
If there's a female ghost,

740
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:23,940
there must be a sorcerer.

741
00:33:23,940 --> 00:33:25,640
You need a sorcerer to catch a ghost.

742
00:33:25,640 --> 00:33:27,230
It's only logical, right?

743
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:30,110
But has anyone envisioned

744
00:33:30,290 --> 00:33:31,550
that this sorcerer...

745
00:33:34,710 --> 00:33:36,140
is also a ghost?

746
00:33:37,750 --> 00:33:39,880
He's in cahoots with the female ghost.

747
00:33:45,230 --> 00:33:47,230
No one would see that coming, right?

748
00:33:50,350 --> 00:33:51,480
But I did.

749
00:33:52,360 --> 00:33:54,640
I think you all get the picture now.

750
00:33:56,270 --> 00:33:57,830
If you do, leave.

751
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:58,640
Mr. Tang,

752
00:33:59,090 --> 00:34:00,570
what do you mean

753
00:34:00,600 --> 00:34:01,400
by leave?

754
00:34:01,420 --> 00:34:03,340
It means, get lost!

755
00:34:03,370 --> 00:34:04,410
Get the hell out!

756
00:34:08,790 --> 00:34:10,060
Manyu, you stay.

757
00:34:11,120 --> 00:34:12,409
I need to talk to you.

758
00:34:31,510 --> 00:34:33,510
You really are a top-notch actress.

759
00:34:35,550 --> 00:34:37,310
You scammed me out of so much money,

760
00:34:37,310 --> 00:34:38,909
and now you even want double.

761
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,800
I've met my match.

762
00:34:43,150 --> 00:34:45,280
Even if the ghost possession was a lie,

763
00:34:45,550 --> 00:34:46,590
think about it:

764
00:34:46,630 --> 00:34:47,960
without me making this scene,

765
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:49,889
how'd there be such citywide buzz?

766
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:51,320
If the movie makes money,

767
00:34:51,320 --> 00:34:52,090
of course I want a cut.

768
00:34:52,090 --> 00:34:54,420
But you guys messed up, you know?

769
00:34:55,030 --> 00:34:56,030
See this?

770
00:34:56,110 --> 00:34:57,590
Someone took a picture of you.

771
00:34:57,590 --> 00:34:58,360
Crystal clear, huh?

772
00:34:58,360 --> 00:34:59,230
It's you, right?

773
00:34:59,230 --> 00:35:00,630
You know how much I paid this journalist

774
00:35:00,630 --> 00:35:02,030
to keep his mouth shut?

775
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:03,880
Mr. Tang,

776
00:35:04,150 --> 00:35:05,510
investing and doing business

777
00:35:05,510 --> 00:35:07,030
are inherently risky.

778
00:35:07,050 --> 00:35:09,150
If you're such a chicken,
why make a movie?

779
00:35:09,150 --> 00:35:10,400
Of course I'm making it!

780
00:35:10,400 --> 00:35:11,550
I mortgaged my car

781
00:35:11,550 --> 00:35:12,280
and my house,

782
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:13,710
and even borrowed from loan sharks.

783
00:35:13,710 --> 00:35:15,360
Cancel the movie now when

784
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:16,480
everything's on the line?

785
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:17,510
Listen.

786
00:35:17,510 --> 00:35:19,230
This movie must be made.

787
00:35:19,400 --> 00:35:20,960
The cameras won't stop!

788
00:35:21,360 --> 00:35:22,230
Fine.

789
00:35:22,710 --> 00:35:24,190
Our cooperation stays.

790
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:26,540
But I must get 10%
of the box office gross,

791
00:35:26,630 --> 00:35:28,110
or I'm leaving right now.

792
00:35:30,660 --> 00:35:31,930
Is this a threat?

793
00:35:33,150 --> 00:35:34,360
This?

794
00:35:34,510 --> 00:35:36,030
Pretty much.

795
00:35:43,800 --> 00:35:45,320
Manzhi threatened me too.

796
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:47,690
Do you know what happened to her...

797
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:49,960
Don't make me laugh.

798
00:35:50,550 --> 00:35:52,150
I'm not like her.

799
00:35:52,630 --> 00:35:54,490
I've been a con artist for so long.

800
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:56,680
I won't be as stupid as her.

801
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:58,610
She committed suicide,

802
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:00,510
but I won't.

803
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:02,840
Manyu,

804
00:36:03,670 --> 00:36:04,840
do we really have to

805
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:06,280
make it this ugly?

806
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:08,280
That depends on your sincerity,

807
00:36:08,710 --> 00:36:09,670
Mr. Tang.

808
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:16,220
That look in your eyes

809
00:36:16,840 --> 00:36:18,550
is so familiar.

810
00:36:18,660 --> 00:36:20,380
I'll let you in on a secret

811
00:36:21,030 --> 00:36:22,840
I haven't told anyone else.

812
00:36:23,630 --> 00:36:25,150
Have you ever considered

813
00:36:26,230 --> 00:36:28,360
that He Manzhi didn't commit suicide?

814
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:37,240
I was just like this,

815
00:36:37,330 --> 00:36:39,080
strangling her neck.

816
00:36:39,190 --> 00:36:40,030
Let go.

817
00:36:40,030 --> 00:36:41,800
She also asked me to let go.

818
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:43,110
Tang Yushan, what are you doing?

819
00:36:43,110 --> 00:36:43,590
Let go!

820
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:44,630
The more she begged me,

821
00:36:44,630 --> 00:36:45,890
the tighter I gripped.

822
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:46,980
The more she struggled,

823
00:36:46,980 --> 00:36:48,980
the harder I squeezed.

824
00:36:49,550 --> 00:36:51,320
Manzhi was also struggling the whole time.

825
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:52,190
Help!

826
00:36:52,190 --> 00:36:54,000
I really want to know what exactly

827
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:54,960
was going through

828
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:57,020
Manzhi's mind right before she died.

829
00:36:57,400 --> 00:36:59,710
Was it fear or regret?

830
00:37:01,150 --> 00:37:01,950
Aren't you...

831
00:37:02,320 --> 00:37:02,920
afraid...

832
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:05,000
of the police?

833
00:37:05,110 --> 00:37:05,920
The police?

834
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:08,000
The police were here.

835
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:09,260
Sorry for the trouble.

836
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:11,000
But it's useless.

837
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:13,800
Has this feeling been
etched on your heart?

838
00:37:14,150 --> 00:37:15,950
This is exactly how Manzhi felt.

839
00:37:15,980 --> 00:37:16,840
Tang Yushan...

840
00:37:28,760 --> 00:37:30,290
Never forget this feeling.

841
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:32,800
So you can learn your lesson.

842
00:37:42,030 --> 00:37:43,280
From now on,

843
00:37:43,710 --> 00:37:45,030
whatever it is,

844
00:37:45,360 --> 00:37:46,630
you do as I say.

845
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:48,110
Keep acting

846
00:37:48,300 --> 00:37:49,680
being possessed by a ghost.

847
00:37:49,680 --> 00:37:52,080
But you won't get a single cent.

848
00:37:52,590 --> 00:37:53,710
Do you understand?

849
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:56,750
At worst, you kill me.

850
00:37:57,230 --> 00:37:59,360
Let's see how you shoot the movie then.

851
00:38:00,280 --> 00:38:01,000
Kill you?

852
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:03,230
Sure.

853
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:04,800
No sweat.

854
00:38:05,150 --> 00:38:06,440
After you die,

855
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,550
I'll find another girl.

856
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:10,920
She'll take over and play the ghost,

857
00:38:11,400 --> 00:38:13,130
and the ghost will possess her.

858
00:38:13,590 --> 00:38:15,110
The headline will be

859
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,710
"He Manzhi's Spirit

860
00:38:17,710 --> 00:38:19,590
Turns on Jiang Manyu:

861
00:38:19,590 --> 00:38:22,590
Another Ghostly Tragedy on Set."

862
00:38:23,230 --> 00:38:24,110
Do you like it?

863
00:38:24,840 --> 00:38:26,440
Will this headline go viral?

864
00:38:32,920 --> 00:38:33,650
Of course...

865
00:38:35,070 --> 00:38:37,190
You have another choice.

866
00:38:37,710 --> 00:38:39,480
Cooperate with me

867
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:41,590
and finish this movie.

868
00:38:41,670 --> 00:38:43,470
As soon as the movie is released,

869
00:38:44,190 --> 00:38:45,190
you'll be famous.

870
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:46,880
Then...

871
00:38:49,710 --> 00:38:51,100
we'll get married.

872
00:38:52,190 --> 00:38:53,510
With me, you'll have

873
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:55,680
plenty of chances to make money.

874
00:38:55,880 --> 00:38:56,590
Live

875
00:38:57,280 --> 00:38:58,030
or die—

876
00:38:59,000 --> 00:38:59,880
make a bet.

877
00:39:13,590 --> 00:39:15,760
Your smile is really charming.

878
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:18,800
Smile.

879
00:39:19,880 --> 00:39:22,510
Smile and I'll let you
walk out of here alive.

880
00:39:26,160 --> 00:39:28,620
Your mother said
you're good at everything,

881
00:39:28,710 --> 00:39:30,910
except for how expressionless you are.

882
00:39:31,070 --> 00:39:31,930
How about this?

883
00:39:32,470 --> 00:39:33,630
Give me a smile.

884
00:39:34,150 --> 00:39:36,880
If you smile, I'll let you
stay in Tianxiang Sect.

885
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:51,000
Your mother has passed away.

886
00:39:51,260 --> 00:39:53,420
This is the last thing she did for you.

887
00:39:54,110 --> 00:39:55,710
From now on, I'm your father,

888
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:58,440
and Tianxiang Sect is your home.

889
00:40:02,550 --> 00:40:03,440
Manzhi.

890
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:04,800
I promise that

891
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:06,510
whatever you say goes from now on.

892
00:40:06,510 --> 00:40:08,310
You can take on any role you want.

893
00:40:09,440 --> 00:40:11,400
Did those rumors

894
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,480
get to you?

895
00:40:12,590 --> 00:40:14,190
They're all lies.

896
00:40:14,190 --> 00:40:16,720
They were the ones
who threw themselves at me.

897
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:18,670
Forget it.

898
00:40:19,320 --> 00:40:21,030
See whoever you want to see.

899
00:40:21,070 --> 00:40:22,510
It's none of my business.

900
00:40:22,510 --> 00:40:23,840
I've booked my ticket anyway.

901
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:25,000
I'm leaving tomorrow.

902
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:26,000
Manzhi, if you...

903
00:40:26,030 --> 00:40:26,630
If you leave,

904
00:40:26,630 --> 00:40:28,630
this family will fall apart.

905
00:40:29,150 --> 00:40:29,670
Cut.

906
00:40:29,670 --> 00:40:30,840
That's about it for this scene.

907
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:31,880
Let's run through the lines

908
00:40:31,880 --> 00:40:33,210
again for safety, okay?

909
00:40:33,510 --> 00:40:35,190
All departments,
let's make final adjustments.

910
00:40:35,190 --> 00:40:36,920
We're going to shoot this take.

911
00:40:43,150 --> 00:40:43,800
Mr. Tang.

912
00:40:44,550 --> 00:40:45,190
Speak.

913
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:47,150
We're almost out of film.

914
00:40:48,480 --> 00:40:49,360
Go buy some.

915
00:40:49,360 --> 00:40:51,280
The crew's accountant told me

916
00:40:51,670 --> 00:40:53,630
we're out of money.

917
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:59,840
Manzhi, I love you.

918
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:02,550
Everything they said is a lie.

919
00:41:02,550 --> 00:41:04,550
They were the ones who initiated it!

920
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:05,760
Who are you playing?

921
00:41:05,760 --> 00:41:07,440
I'm playing you.

922
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:09,000
Were you even trying to be like me?

923
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:09,760
Take a break.

924
00:41:09,760 --> 00:41:10,480
Yang Xiaozhong!

925
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,000
Yes!

926
00:41:11,400 --> 00:41:13,360
Clear the set.

927
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:15,110
Leave only Manyu and me.

928
00:41:15,110 --> 00:41:17,510
I need to give her a quick lesson on

929
00:41:17,510 --> 00:41:19,670
the character's state of mind
at that time.

930
00:41:19,670 --> 00:41:20,880
Okay, um, let's have

931
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:21,710
a meal break, okay?

932
00:41:21,710 --> 00:41:22,960
Go eat, everyone.

933
00:41:23,070 --> 00:41:24,320
Thank you, Director.

934
00:41:24,510 --> 00:41:25,840
Come back after eating.

935
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:29,070
I think it's very necessary
for me to tell you

936
00:41:29,150 --> 00:41:30,440
the details of that time.

937
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:31,630
The given circumstance

938
00:41:31,630 --> 00:41:33,030
is that she wasn't seated.

939
00:41:33,030 --> 00:41:33,920
At that time,

940
00:41:34,150 --> 00:41:34,960
she was here.

941
00:41:34,960 --> 00:41:35,960
Yes, right here.

942
00:41:36,590 --> 00:41:37,670
That day,

943
00:41:37,670 --> 00:41:38,920
we had a misunderstanding.

944
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:40,920
I tried desperately to explain to her.

945
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,100
I couldn't get through to her at al—

946
00:41:42,100 --> 00:41:42,790
Oh, right!

947
00:41:44,760 --> 00:41:47,020
She even locked the door from the inside,

948
00:41:47,070 --> 00:41:48,360
locking me out

949
00:41:48,510 --> 00:41:50,040
and insisting on a divorce.

950
00:41:54,590 --> 00:41:55,510
Honey.

951
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:58,320
I was wrong.

952
00:41:58,630 --> 00:42:00,480
Open the door. Let's talk.

953
00:42:01,070 --> 00:42:02,280
Tang Yushan,

954
00:42:03,030 --> 00:42:04,320
I'm begging you.

955
00:42:04,320 --> 00:42:05,880
Can you just let me go?

956
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:07,230
Open the door!

957
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:09,760
Please, can you let me go?

958
00:42:09,760 --> 00:42:12,400
You're my wife, and you're begging me?

959
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:14,070
Open the door!

960
00:42:14,070 --> 00:42:16,800
I treat you so well,
yet you want to divorce me!

961
00:42:16,800 --> 00:42:19,000
Tang Yushan, you don't love me at all!

962
00:42:27,280 --> 00:42:29,680
We can finally have a proper conversation.

963
00:42:32,230 --> 00:42:33,480
In the script,

964
00:42:34,480 --> 00:42:36,210
it says I smashed the door open.

965
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:38,880
But actually,

966
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:40,510
I couldn't bear to do it.

967
00:42:40,510 --> 00:42:41,710
Our door is

968
00:42:41,840 --> 00:42:43,110
really too expensive.

969
00:42:43,310 --> 00:42:44,630
It was custom made.

970
00:42:45,840 --> 00:42:49,000
Guess who helped me
open the door in the end?

971
00:42:49,880 --> 00:42:50,880
Director Fan,

972
00:42:51,190 --> 00:42:53,400
could I trouble your men to

973
00:42:53,400 --> 00:42:55,110
do me another small favor?

974
00:43:11,230 --> 00:43:12,030
Are you now

975
00:43:12,410 --> 00:43:13,810
clear on the characters'

976
00:43:14,280 --> 00:43:16,320
relationships and situations?

977
00:43:17,030 --> 00:43:19,070
You guys scammed a lot of money from me.

978
00:43:19,070 --> 00:43:21,710
Now I don't even have money to buy film.

979
00:43:21,960 --> 00:43:23,220
Where's that scammer?

980
00:43:23,880 --> 00:43:25,410
He has to spit the money out.

981
00:43:25,510 --> 00:43:26,970
He ran away a long time ago.

982
00:43:27,230 --> 00:43:28,110
I can't reach him either.

983
00:43:28,110 --> 00:43:29,110
You can't reach him,

984
00:43:29,110 --> 00:43:30,910
or you just don't want to tell me?

985
00:43:31,190 --> 00:43:32,430
Think again.

986
00:43:38,400 --> 00:43:39,000
Okay.

987
00:43:40,280 --> 00:43:41,230
Understood.

988
00:43:41,960 --> 00:43:43,230
How about this?

989
00:43:44,000 --> 00:43:46,060
I'll give you a few months to recover.

990
00:43:46,320 --> 00:43:47,520
During those months,

991
00:43:48,030 --> 00:43:49,280
think it over carefully.

992
00:43:49,280 --> 00:43:50,880
Maybe in a few months,

993
00:43:50,880 --> 00:43:52,540
there will be more media hype.

994
00:43:53,550 --> 00:43:54,760
It's settled then.

995
00:43:55,710 --> 00:43:56,440
Mr. Tang!

996
00:43:57,320 --> 00:43:58,150
Mr. Tang.

997
00:44:00,150 --> 00:44:01,200
Mr. Tang, you...

998
00:44:01,280 --> 00:44:02,420
I'm explaining the scene!

999
00:44:02,420 --> 00:44:03,090
What is it?

1000
00:44:03,630 --> 00:44:04,710
Someone just came.

1001
00:44:04,710 --> 00:44:06,360
Another company in Yucheng is

1002
00:44:06,360 --> 00:44:07,780
releasing a movie next week

1003
00:44:07,780 --> 00:44:09,310
with the same gimmick as us—

1004
00:44:09,360 --> 00:44:10,670
also starring a ghost.

1005
00:44:10,800 --> 00:44:13,110
Their boss sent someone with a note,

1006
00:44:13,140 --> 00:44:14,600
inviting you to watch the movie.

1007
00:44:13,440 --> 00:44:15,440
[Tiansheng Pictures:
3F, Yongnian Building, Xiaoshizi Street]

1008
00:44:14,630 --> 00:44:16,280
They want to apologize to you in person

1009
00:44:16,280 --> 00:44:18,840
for stealing our thunder.

1010
00:44:30,670 --> 00:44:31,550
Mr. Tang,

1011
00:44:32,230 --> 00:44:33,800
I heard you were looking for me.

1012
00:44:33,800 --> 00:44:35,600
I'm just about to play the movie.

1013
00:44:35,960 --> 00:44:37,110
Want to sit down

1014
00:44:37,110 --> 00:44:38,590
and enjoy it together?

1015
00:44:44,110 --> 00:44:45,150
It's you.

1016
00:44:45,800 --> 00:44:47,440
I was just looking for you.

1017
00:44:55,360 --> 00:44:56,360
Where's my money?

1018
00:44:56,960 --> 00:44:57,880
I invited

1019
00:44:57,880 --> 00:44:59,440
more than just you today.

1020
00:44:59,630 --> 00:45:02,030
After all, everyone wants to
see a movie with a ghost.

1021
00:45:02,030 --> 00:45:03,070
In a moment,

1022
00:45:03,070 --> 00:45:05,150
there will be many prominent figures.

1023
00:45:05,150 --> 00:45:08,070
Mr. Tang, it wouldn't be
very decent of you to act like this.

1024
00:45:08,070 --> 00:45:08,960
Decent?

1025
00:45:10,670 --> 00:45:12,150
I didn't realize you were

1026
00:45:12,870 --> 00:45:14,540
also in the same industry.

1027
00:45:14,590 --> 00:45:16,050
You piece of showbiz scum!

1028
00:45:16,070 --> 00:45:18,400
You scammed my money
and copied my idea, huh?

1029
00:45:18,400 --> 00:45:20,190
I didn't copy your idea.

1030
00:45:20,510 --> 00:45:22,150
The ghost was caught a long time ago.

1031
00:45:22,150 --> 00:45:23,000
Besides,

1032
00:45:23,360 --> 00:45:25,480
you're shooting a movie,
which is all fake.

1033
00:45:25,480 --> 00:45:26,760
I'm shooting a documentary,

1034
00:45:26,760 --> 00:45:27,550
which is all real.

1035
00:45:27,550 --> 00:45:28,760
Cut your crap!

1036
00:45:29,550 --> 00:45:31,000
How can a fraud like you make movies

1037
00:45:31,000 --> 00:45:32,030
and catch ghosts?

1038
00:45:32,190 --> 00:45:34,030
Our Tiansheng Pictures has always

1039
00:45:34,030 --> 00:45:35,510
faced a lack of funds.

1040
00:45:35,510 --> 00:45:36,920
But thanks to your funding,

1041
00:45:36,920 --> 00:45:38,800
it's now a big production.

1042
00:45:38,800 --> 00:45:39,920
I've decided

1043
00:45:39,920 --> 00:45:42,070
I must give you credit for this movie.

1044
00:45:42,550 --> 00:45:43,680
Not only the credit,

1045
00:45:43,920 --> 00:45:45,150
but you must also

1046
00:45:45,590 --> 00:45:47,650
take the lion's share of the profits.

1047
00:45:49,360 --> 00:45:50,150
Check it out.

1048
00:45:51,360 --> 00:45:52,110
Fine.

1049
00:45:53,480 --> 00:45:54,680
If you're lying to me,

1050
00:45:55,510 --> 00:45:56,440
I'll kill you

1051
00:45:56,440 --> 00:45:58,170
and chop you up to feed the pigs.

1052
00:46:03,440 --> 00:46:05,190
I've been a con artist for so long.

1053
00:46:05,190 --> 00:46:06,670
I won't be as stupid as her.

1054
00:46:07,190 --> 00:46:08,590
She committed suicide,

1055
00:46:08,670 --> 00:46:09,800
but I won't.

1056
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:11,320
Do we really have to

1057
00:46:11,320 --> 00:46:12,510
make it this ugly?

1058
00:46:13,230 --> 00:46:15,030
That depends on your sincerity,

1059
00:46:15,960 --> 00:46:17,150
Mr. Tang.

1060
00:46:19,550 --> 00:46:21,070
Have you ever considered

1061
00:46:21,920 --> 00:46:24,050
that He Manzhi didn't commit suicide?

1062
00:46:25,590 --> 00:46:27,110
I was just like this,

1063
00:46:27,320 --> 00:46:29,150
strangling her neck.

1064
00:46:29,550 --> 00:46:32,080
The more she begged me,
the tighter I gripped.

1065
00:46:32,230 --> 00:46:34,830
The more she struggled,
the harder I squeezed.

1066
00:46:34,840 --> 00:46:36,710
Manzhi was also struggling the whole time.

1067
00:46:36,710 --> 00:46:37,960
I really want to know what exactly

1068
00:46:37,960 --> 00:46:39,000
was going through

1069
00:46:39,000 --> 00:46:41,030
Manzhi's mind right before she died.

1070
00:46:41,030 --> 00:46:43,480
Aren't you afraid of the police?

1071
00:46:43,670 --> 00:46:44,510
The police?

1072
00:46:44,710 --> 00:46:45,920
The police were here,

1073
00:46:46,190 --> 00:46:47,280
but it's useless.

1074
00:46:47,280 --> 00:46:49,080
This is exactly how Manzhi felt.

1075
00:46:49,360 --> 00:46:50,840
You two are in cahoots,

1076
00:46:51,190 --> 00:46:52,450
trying to do me in, huh?

1077
00:46:52,670 --> 00:46:53,280
Stop!

1078
00:46:53,670 --> 00:46:55,070
Never forget this feeling.

1079
00:46:55,070 --> 00:46:56,000
Put that down!

1080
00:46:57,780 --> 00:46:59,450
Thank goodness you're here!

1081
00:47:00,030 --> 00:47:00,880
He's a scammer.

1082
00:47:00,880 --> 00:47:01,510
Arrest him.

1083
00:47:01,510 --> 00:47:02,170
Arrest him!

1084
00:47:02,480 --> 00:47:02,920
Cuff him!

1085
00:47:02,920 --> 00:47:03,980
What are you doing?

1086
00:47:04,020 --> 00:47:05,320
What are you doing?

1087
00:47:05,400 --> 00:47:06,440
Arrest him!

1088
00:47:06,590 --> 00:47:07,630
No!

1089
00:47:07,630 --> 00:47:08,690
What are you doing?

1090
00:47:09,440 --> 00:47:09,960
Let go!

1091
00:47:09,960 --> 00:47:11,230
Tang Yushan,

1092
00:47:11,380 --> 00:47:13,820
you committed murder.

1093
00:47:14,510 --> 00:47:16,510
The evidence is all here.

1094
00:47:17,610 --> 00:47:18,530
Come with us.

1095
00:47:19,000 --> 00:47:19,800
Take him away!

1096
00:47:20,000 --> 00:47:21,550
You got the wrong guy!

1097
00:47:21,550 --> 00:47:22,590
Arrest him!

1098
00:47:22,670 --> 00:47:23,480
Just you wait.

1099
00:47:23,480 --> 00:47:25,190
When I get out, I'll kill you.

1100
00:47:25,280 --> 00:47:26,190
Cut the crap!

1101
00:47:26,190 --> 00:47:27,320
You fraud!

1102
00:47:28,070 --> 00:47:29,110
You're not really going to

1103
00:47:29,110 --> 00:47:31,310
finish shooting Tang's movie, are you?

1104
00:47:31,320 --> 00:47:32,280
Look over there.

1105
00:47:32,880 --> 00:47:34,480
He's a gofer I borrowed

1106
00:47:34,710 --> 00:47:35,440
from Fourth Batou.

1107
00:47:35,440 --> 00:47:37,640
I think you should check this out first.

1108
00:47:39,150 --> 00:47:41,110
I installed a hidden compartment
in Tang Yushan's

1109
00:47:41,110 --> 00:47:42,110
conference room.

1110
00:47:42,400 --> 00:47:43,530
When the time comes,

1111
00:47:43,880 --> 00:47:45,550
I'll intentionally give myself away,

1112
00:47:45,550 --> 00:47:46,810
and let Yang Xiaozhong

1113
00:47:47,150 --> 00:47:48,280
find a chance to film it.

1114
00:47:48,280 --> 00:47:50,610
But Tang Yushan's case is already closed.

1115
00:47:51,030 --> 00:47:53,090
How will you convince Wang Zhicheng?

1116
00:47:53,880 --> 00:47:55,280
Reopening the case

1117
00:47:55,670 --> 00:47:56,840
is too much trouble.

1118
00:47:57,000 --> 00:47:58,630
Do you know who

1119
00:47:59,480 --> 00:48:00,480
closed this case?

1120
00:48:01,190 --> 00:48:02,440
Fan Jialie.

1121
00:48:02,510 --> 00:48:04,190
I can provide you with evidence.

1122
00:48:04,190 --> 00:48:05,320
For a case like this,

1123
00:48:05,510 --> 00:48:06,970
first, you can gain merit,

1124
00:48:07,110 --> 00:48:08,150
and second,

1125
00:48:08,150 --> 00:48:10,080
you can interrogate him yourself.

1126
00:48:10,550 --> 00:48:12,190
Only then will we know

1127
00:48:12,510 --> 00:48:14,710
how much he actually gave Director Fan.

1128
00:48:16,070 --> 00:48:17,590
Then how can you be sure

1129
00:48:17,590 --> 00:48:19,230
that He Manzhi was murdered?

1130
00:48:21,070 --> 00:48:22,670
Because a person who is

1131
00:48:23,360 --> 00:48:24,960
killed first and then hung up

1132
00:48:25,920 --> 00:48:27,230
will have a stiff body.

1133
00:48:28,670 --> 00:48:29,840
So her feet

1134
00:48:30,460 --> 00:48:31,950
will also be flat.

1135
00:48:40,110 --> 00:48:42,590
This contains the footage
Yang Xiaozhong took of you,

1136
00:48:42,590 --> 00:48:44,990
as well as unreleased footage
of He Manzhi.

1137
00:48:46,070 --> 00:48:47,360
Are you really just going to burn it?

1138
00:48:47,360 --> 00:48:48,440
I'm a scammer.

1139
00:48:48,710 --> 00:48:50,070
The lesser people know

1140
00:48:50,070 --> 00:48:51,670
what I look like, the better.

1141
00:48:51,760 --> 00:48:52,760
Only by burning it

1142
00:48:52,760 --> 00:48:54,220
can Sect Master be at ease.

1143
00:48:54,440 --> 00:48:55,360
Hold it.

1144
00:48:57,000 --> 00:48:59,000
There's someone who still needs it.

1145
00:49:00,190 --> 00:49:01,070
I just saw you borrowing

1146
00:49:01,070 --> 00:49:03,200
a copy of "Midnight" from the library.

1147
00:49:03,400 --> 00:49:04,710
How is it?

1148
00:49:05,320 --> 00:49:06,720
The writing is too sharp.

1149
00:49:07,000 --> 00:49:09,590
But "Border Town,"
which you recommended, is good.

1150
00:49:09,590 --> 00:49:11,000
I read a few pages of the copy

1151
00:49:11,000 --> 00:49:11,880
my roommate borrowed

1152
